      "updated": 1787494351298,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Admin pushes recommended weights on-chain\n• Quadratic incentives pull the basket\ntoward\n  the target weights\n• Reward for supplying under-weighted\n  currencies, penalty for over-weighted ones\n• Token value backed by the FIAT\n  stablecoin basket\n• We assumed the CBDC stablecoin for each\ncurrency in the basket already existed",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Admin pushes recommended weights on-chain\n• Quadratic incentives pull the basket toward\n  the target weights\n• Reward for supplying under-weighted\n  currencies, penalty for over-weighted ones\n• Token value backed by the FIAT\n  stablecoin basket\n• We assumed the CBDC stablecoin for each currency in the basket already existed",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1d",
      "autoResize": false
    },
