      "updated": 1787494411312,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A blockchain-based regional currency (à la Euro):\nweaker economies borrow stability from stronger\nones, stronger economies trade with less FX risk\n& cost. Backed by a regional FIAT-stablecoin basket.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A blockchain-based regional currency (à la Euro):\nweaker economies borrow stability from stronger\nones, stronger economies trade with less FX risk\n& cost. Backed by a regional FIAT-stablecoin basket.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1o",
      "autoResize": false
